WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.432
Module 1 focused on values, calculations, and output.

00:00:04.432 --> 00:00:08.582
The big change now is that Python can choose a path.

00:00:08.582 --> 00:00:12.312
A condition asks a True or False question.

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:17.057
A branch is the block of code that runs when a condition is satisfied.

00:00:17.057 --> 00:00:19.887
A loop repeats a block of work.

00:00:19.887 --> 00:00:23.855
Loop control changes when that repetition stops or skips.

00:00:24.354 --> 00:00:30.291
Think of the workflow as data value, condition, action, then the next value.

00:00:30.291 --> 00:00:34.633
That simple structure is behind a surprising amount of analytics logic.
